# Keep repository-only working documents out of `git archive` output.
# The release archive is produced with `git archive`, so a path marked
# export-ignore stays under version control but never enters the archive.
#
# The deposit is the analysis code. Manuscript prose is submitted separately to
# the journal and must not travel with the archive, so the whole directory is
# excluded: a local copy is ignored by .gitignore, and this rule keeps any
# committed manuscript out of a future release as well.

manuscript/ export-ignore
